# Split text token (stt)

Rewrite **only the selected** `className` / `cn()` styles. Do not edit other code.

## Speed (mandatory)

- Do **not** run `tsc`, lint, tests, or any verification.
- Ignore frontend-rules typecheck/lint for this task.
- Do **not** change layout, spacing, or DOM. Replace the token; keep every other class.

## Tokens

Classes like `heading-sm-sb`, `heading-lg-b`, `body-md-r`, `body-lg-m`, `display-xl`.

Look up the definition in `src/styles/figma_var.css` (`@layer utilities`). Do not guess sizes.

## Expand into these `cn()` lines (in this order)

1. **Font line** — all `font-*`: family then weight (`"font-montserrat font-semibold"`).
2. **Size line** — `"text-[Npx] tb:text-[Npx] dk:text-[Npx]"`.
3. **Leading line** — `"leading-[130%]"` (use the CSS `line-height` as-is: `%`, `1`, `110%`, …).
4. **Color line** — only if a `text-*` color already exists (`"text-gray-900"`). Do not invent a color.

Then keep the rest of the original classes (layout, clamp, cursor, …) after these lines.

Wrap with `cn(...)`. If `cn` is missing, add `import { cn } from "@/app/utils/cn";`.

## Maps

**Family:** `--font-montserrat` → `font-montserrat`; `--font-fraunces` → `font-fraunces`; `--font-black-marker` → `font-black-marker`; `--font-lora` → `font-lora`; `--font-urbanist` → `font-urbanist`.

**Weight:** `400` → `font-normal`; `500` → `font-medium`; `600` → `font-semibold`; `700` → `font-bold`; `800` → `font-extrabold`.

**Size:** `font-size: var(--text-22)` → resolve `--text-22` in the same file:

- `:root` default → base `text-[…]`
- `@media (width >= 744px)` → `tb:text-[…]`
- `@media (width >= 1200px)` → `dk:text-[…]`
- `@media (width >= 1700px)` → `dk-lg:text-[…]` when that step exists

Follow `--text-*` → `--num-*` → pixel value (`--num-15: 15px` → `15px`). Use `px` in the class, not `rem`. Base first, then `tb`, then `dk`.

Delete the token class (`heading-sm-sb`, …) after expanding.

## Example

```tsx
// before
<h3 className="flex-1 heading-sm-sb text-gray-900 line-clamp-2 break-words cursor-default">

// after (heading-sm-sb → montserrat 600, --text-22 = 15 / 18 / 22, leading 130%)
<h3
  className={cn(
    "flex-1  line-clamp-2 break-words cursor-default",
    "font-montserrat font-semibold text-gray-900",
    "text-[15px] tb:text-[18px] dk:text-[22px]",
    "leading-[130%]",
  )}
>
```
